{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/stressMajorizationLayout(initial:edgeLength:tolerance:maxIterations:)"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"GraphDrawing"}],"title":"stressMajorizationLayout(initial:edgeLength:tolerance:maxIterations:)","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P0A7DrawingE24stressMajorizationLayout7initial10edgeLength9tolerance13maxIterationsAD0C0Vy6VertexQzGANSg_Sd5Edges_5IndexQZXESdSitF","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"StressMajorizationLayout.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphDrawing\/StressMajorizationLayout.swift#L34"},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stressMajorizationLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"initial","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"edgeLength","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stressMajorizationLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"initial","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"edgeLength","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = { _ in 1 }, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 1e-4, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 1000) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The target distance d_ij of two vertices is their shortest-path distance with "},{"code":"edgeLength","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(hops by default); between components it is 1 + L̄·√n, L̄ the mean edge length. The drawing minimizes the stress Σ_{i<j} d_ij⁻² (‖x_i − x_j‖ − d_ij)²,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which with these weights is Kamada and Kawai’s energy. Each step updates every vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order to the minimizer of a majorant of the stress in that vertex (Gansner,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Koren and North’s localized update), so the stress never increases. The run stops one step"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after a step that lowered the stress by at most "},{"code":"tolerance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" times its value (each step"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"measures its starting stress on the way), or after "},{"code":"maxIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" steps. A tolerance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"below the default 10⁻⁴ can carry the run past a plateau to a lower stress."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The start is "},{"code":"initial","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or by default "},{"code":"circularLayout(radius: L̄)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Scaled by the mean edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"length, the default start makes scaling every length by a power of 2 scale every step’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drawing by exactly that factor, and by any other factor up to rounding. The layout uses no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"randomness. A directed graph is drawn through "},{"code":"undirectedView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Gansner, Koren and North, “Graph drawing by stress majorization”, Graph Drawing (GD"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"2004), LNCS 3383, 2005."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Kamada and Kawai, “An algorithm for drawing general undirected graphs”, Information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Processing Letters 31(1), 1989."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(n·(n + m)) for the distances by breadth-first search (O(n·m log n) by Dijkstra when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lengths differ), then O(n²) per step. The reciprocal target distances are kept in single","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"precision for the pairs i < j only, 2n² bytes (200 MB at 10⁴ vertices). ","type":"text"},{"code":"stress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"drawing are those of distances rounded to about 7 significant digits.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every edge length is positive and finite; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance ≥ 0"},{"type":"text","text":";"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations ≥ 0"},{"type":"text","text":"; every vertex of the graph is in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"initial"},{"type":"text","text":", at a finite position,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when it is given."}]}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A drawing whose distances match the graph’s, by stress majorization.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/stressmajorizationlayout(initial:edgelength:tolerance:maxiterations:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/Drawing":{"role":"symbol","title":"Drawing","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Drawing"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Drawing"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A position in the plane for each vertex, in a fixed vertex order: what every layout in this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"module returns, and what a caller passes as a starting drawing.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/drawing","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols/Graph/stressMajorizationLayout(initial:edgeLength:tolerance:maxIterations:)":{"role":"symbol","title":"stressMajorizationLayout(initial:edgeLe